text I don't know if they only just came up the hill, but two motorcycles have stopped near the school gates.
text Even from here, I can see that the riders are young men, both without helmets.
text One of them waves his hand, signaling to the other.
text The two motorcycles start running wild on the school grounds, their engines roaring loudly.
text I vaguely remember something similar happening at the end of last year.
text The culprits that time had been students from the nearby industrial high school.
text Are they really that pissed off that we're the best school in town?
